                                "sense_id": "8d770a72-c07e-3386-94b4-49318f1fa2e6",
                                "text": "Mrs Durbeyfield, excited by her song, trod the rocker with all the spring that was left in her after a long day's seething in the suds."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5f90f7f-0263-35b8-a4fe-9d362c136ea2",
